~ start

A voice calls to you from deep with the void.
The Abyss: it shines..
The Abyss: so utterly fascinating..

you attempt to move but you couldnt move a finger.. 
you're paralyzed

The Abyss: you. what is your name?

The Abyss: an earthly soul stumbles upon my domain

the more you stare the more you feel like the abyss itself is staring right back at you.

The Abyss: let me take a good look at you

suddenly a pair of eyes are visible.

you feel goosebump on the hairs on your arm..

The Abyss: ah fear.. the song of of despair

The Abyss: your soul, it shines the most within the sea of souls..

The Abyss: it’s mine for the taking, of course..

you attempt to ask what is it, but words fail to come out of your mouth

The Abyss: I will see you soon.

The Abyss: I expect you to welcome me whole-heartly
…
you wake up
do _end_level()
=> END
